  "name": "Chicken and egg white breakfast bowl",
  "description": "Crisped potato with cooked chicken breast, soft-set egg whites and wilted spinach — a savoury breakfast bowl in twenty minutes.",
  "iconKey": "bowl_dash",
  "instructions": [
    "Scrub the potato and dice it small, then chop the bell pepper.",
    "Warm the olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat, add the potato in a single layer and cook it undisturbed for 6 minutes.",
    "Stir in the bell pepper and the diced cooked chicken breast and cook for 3 minutes, until warmed through.",
    "Push everything to one side of the pan, pour the egg whites into the clear half and stir them gently until they set in soft curds.",
    "Fold the spinach through the pan until it wilts, season with the salt and the black pepper, and divide between two bowls."
